Next, we binned recovery dynamics at Day 28 into ‘recover, intermediate, and lost’ categories as described previously (Figure 3A). While the UHRF1 WT cover recovered over 70% of hypomethylated CpGs (Δβ−valueDay3-Day0\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
